msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:276
msgid "Every week at 8:00 AM"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:278
msgid ""
"You write for the blog \"{{ site_name }}\".\n"
"\n"
"TOPIC (edit me!): practical tips our readers can use — pick one fresh, specific angle each time.\n"
"\n"
"Write an original blog post on that topic: an engaging title and 4-6 short HTML paragraphs (<p>…</p>, optional <h2> subheadings). No invented facts.\n"
"\n"
"Return ONLY JSON: {\"title\": \"…\", \"content\": \"…\"}"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:301
msgid "Turn Feeds Into Drafts"
msgstr ""

