msgid "When a new RSS item appears"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:312
msgid ""
"You write for the blog \"{{ site_name }}\".\n"
"\n"
"Below is a news item from another site. Write a SHORT original post about it in our own voice: summarise the key points in your own words (never copy sentences), 2-4 HTML paragraphs, and end with: <p>Source: <a href=\"{{ trigger.link }}\">{{ trigger.title }}</a></p>\n"
"\n"
"Return ONLY JSON: {\"title\": \"…\", \"content\": \"…\"}\n"
"\n"
"SOURCE TITLE: {{ trigger.title }}\n"
"SOURCE CONTENT:\n"
"{{ trigger.content }}"
